  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Integrated Household Survey Program 2018-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support the Malawi Integrated Household Survey (IHS) Program over the period 2018-2020 for increasing the availability, quality, timeliness and relevance of household survey data. The support will cover partial costs of the Fifth Integrated Household Survey (IHS5) 2019/20 and the Integrated Household Panel Survey (IHPS) 2019.</narrative>
  </description>
